==German==

===Etymology===
From a word with the meaning of [[hill]], not related with {{m|de|Maul||mouth}}. More at [[mouldwarp]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|De-at-Maulwurf.ogg|Audio (Austria)|lang=de}}
